{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/linkersets"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"LinkerSets","symbolKind":"module","externalID":"LinkerSets","modules":[{"name":"LinkerSets"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Declarations that register themselves at compile time and are found at run time across every module a program links.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An attached macro emits a small record into a section LinkerSets owns, and a typed run-time API"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enumerates every record of one kind in a deterministic order. Each record carries a kind, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clients share the mechanism without seeing each other’s records. Failures are typed errors; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"run-time API never traps."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A declaration registers itself with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSetEntry(kind:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", tagged with a kind: four ASCII","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"characters read as a 32-bit integer. A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LinkerSets\/documentation\/LinkerSets\/LinkerSet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" of that kind finds every such declaration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at run time:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import LinkerSets","","enum Routes {","    @LinkerSetEntry(kind: 0x726F_7574)  \/\/ \"rout\"","    static let home = Route(path: \"\/\")","}","","let routes = LinkerSet<Route>(kind: LinkerSetKind(rawValue: 0x726F_7